{
  "name": "久久小说下载网 (aijjxs.com)",
  "description": "久久小说下载网全站采集。TXT电子书下载站，UTF-8编码，cheerio引擎。分类页/txt/{cat}/用div.listbg列表，书名span.title a链接、作者/状态/大小在span.mainGreen中。书详情页/txt/{id}.html标题从<title>标签正则提取（去掉txt下载后缀）、分类从div.kv正则提取（去掉标签前缀）、.intro-panel .desc简介、封面从首个article.panel取img。分页用a[href*=index_]数字翻页。15个分类映射，封面域名image.jjjjxsw.com。",
  "enabled": true,
  "listUrl": "https://www.aijjxs.com/txt/{catId}/",
  "listSelector": {
    "type": "css",
    "value": ".catalog .listbg span.title a"
  },
  "listPagination": {
